    <string name="report_btrc_guide_title">BTRC &amp; Carrier IMEI Blacklist Guide</string>
    <string name="report_btrc_guide_step1">1. Dial *#06# beforehand or copy your IMEI from this app.</string>
    <string name="report_btrc_guide_step2">2. File a General Diary (GD) at your nearest Police Station in Bangladesh.</string>
    <string name="report_btrc_guide_step3">3. Submit a copy of the GD to your mobile operator (Grameenphone, Banglalink, Robi, Teletalk) or BTRC to blacklist the handset nationwide via EIR (Equipment Identity Register).</string>
